    "text": "自分の心情とか、弱いところとか\r\n見破られてるような",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういう意味では怖い、と\r\n言えなくもないかもしれないけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011020230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ふむ……そっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "why",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701102/2017011020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011020240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "何も考えてないと思うっす",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701102/2017011020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nだから、取り繕っても意味がないんだろうなぁって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011020250,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "ん―……よくわかんないっす\r\nそれが美しいっすか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201701102/2017011020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……ははっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2017011020260,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "…………？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
